omp-harness2 is an independent implementation inspired by:
Harness²: Recursive Agent Harnessing for an Open World, Ruiyao Xu et al. (2026).
Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.14224 (CC BY 4.0)
Reference implementation: https://github.com/google-research/harness2 (Apache-2.0)

Oh My Pi is a separate MIT-licensed project:
https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi

This distribution does not bundle the OMP executable, provider credentials,
benchmark data, or third-party runtime dependencies.
